# local-only demo review pages (/dev/*)
#
# Retired from the repo twice — #119 removed sixteen of them so the public site
# is only the site, and #125 removed the one #123 had added as a droppable
# commit that a squash-merge took anyway. Ignoring the directory is what stops
# the third time: a review page written here cannot be staged, so it cannot ship.
/src/app/dev/
